.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Rapp.history
.httr-oauth
.quarto

# --- Stata ---
# Batch mode rewrites logs on every run: regenerable, never source.
*.log
*.smcl
*.dta.bak

# --- LaTeX build artefacts (Overleaf compiles from source) ---
*.aux
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz

# --- macOS ---
.DS_Store

# --- Secrets ---
.Renviron
.env

# --- Data policy -------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw downloads (GHED, WDI) stay local: large, redistributable-unclear, and
# regenerable from the source portals. Provenance is recorded in data/raw/README.md.
#
# The BUILT panel (data/G3.dta) IS tracked — it is the graded deliverable and
# must survive a fresh clone.
*/data/raw/*
!*/data/raw/.gitkeep
!*/data/raw/README.md

# Keep output/ folders in the tree even when empty.
!*/output/**/.gitkeep

# --- Development Economics benchmark (authors' code, regenerable) -------------
development_economics/benchmark/Code/
development_economics/benchmark/Data/
development_economics/benchmark/Figures/
